Problem statement
Ninja was very fond of patterns. For a given integer ‘N’, he wants to make the Reverse N-Star Triangle.
Example:

Input: ‘N’ = 3

Output: 

*****
 ***
  *

Solution: 

public class Solution {
    public static void nStarTriangle(int n) {
        
        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {

            for (int s = 1; s <= i - 1; s++) {
                System.out.print(" ");
            }

            for (int j = 1; j <= 2*n - 2*i + 1; j++) {
                System.out.print("*");
            }

            System.out.println();
        }
    }
}
}
